 and persons aged ≥18 years were used to calculate rates\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"2004--2008 crash data and census data were aggregated separately, and an annualized rate was calculated for each state.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The annualized rates then were compared with 2008 state-specific fatality rates for all crashes involving passenger vehicles.\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 2\", \"q\": \"Rates suppressed because numerators were <20.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}